    "['interface [interface_name]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0.0', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper commands to Huawei equivalent commands for enabling protocols on interface ge-0/0/0.0:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/0/0.0\\n mpls\\n mpls ldp\\n mpls rsvp-te\\n ospf enable 0 area 0\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Huawei devices:\\n1. MPLS is enabled globally and per interface\\n2. LDP and RSVP are enabled as sub-commands under MPLS\\n3. OSPF is enabled per interface with area specification\\n4. The interface naming follows Huawei's convention (GigabitEthernet instead of ge)\", 'trans_template': 'interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0.0'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper commands to Huawei equivalent commands for enabling protocols on interface ge-0/0/0.0:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/0/0.0\\n mpls\\n mpls ldp\\n mpls rsvp-te\\n ospf enable 0 area 0\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Huawei devices:\\n1. MPLS is enabled globally and per interface\\n2. LDP and RSVP are enabled as sub-commands under MPLS\\n3. OSPF is enabled per interface with area specification\\n4. The interface naming follows Huawei's convention (GigabitEthernet instead of ge)\", 'trans_template': 'mpls'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls ldp', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper commands to Huawei equivalent commands for enabling protocols on interface ge-0/0/0.0:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet0/0/0.0\\n mpls\\n mpls ldp\\n mpls rsvp-te\\n ospf enable 0 area 0\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Huawei devices:\\n1. MPLS is enabled globally and per interface\\n2. LDP and RSVP are enabled as sub-commands under MPLS\\n3. OSPF is enabled per interface with area specifi